<title>INDIA: BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-INDIAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the</p>
<p>Indian Open badminton championships on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Tam Kai Chuen (Hong Kong) beat Abhin Shyam Gupta (India) 8-15</p>
<p>15-8 15-11</p>
<p>Sidharth Jain (India) beat Tam Lok Tin (Hong Kong) 15-18 15-10</p>
<p>15-3</p>
<p>Wong Choon Hann (Malaysia) beat Deepankar Bhattacharya (India)</p>
<p>18-16 17-18 15-11</p>
<p>Vikrant Patwardhan (India) beat Yap Yee Hup (Malaysia) 15-12</p>
<p>15-12</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Choi Ma-ree (South Korea) beat Felicity Gallup (England) 4-11</p>
<p>11-4 11-4</p>
<p>Aparna Popat (India) beat Park So-yan (Korea) 11-6 11-6</p>
<p>Manjusha Kanwar (India) beat Lee Winnie (Malaysia) 11-3 12-11</p>
</text>
